</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>dns-sd -B _airplay._tcp
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 查询打印机</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>dns-sd -B _ipp._tcp
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>dns-sd -B _smb._tcp
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>dns-sd -B _ssh._tcp
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>dns-sd -B _googlecast._tcp
</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="查看那些应用阻止了系统休眠">查看那些应用阻止了系统休眠</h3>
<p><code>pmset -g assertions</code></p>
